==Write the report==
Highlight on "Writ": Writ==e the report==   [Writ]
Highlight on "Writ": ==Write the report==   [Writ]

**==Writ==**==e the report==
Bold on "Writ": ==Write the report==   [Writ]

==*Writ*==*e the report*
Highlight on "Writ": *Write the report*   [Writ]

*==Writ==e the report*
Italic on "Writ": ==Writ==*e the report*   [Writ]

A **tip with strong** text
Italic on "A **t": *A* ***t*ip with strong** text   [A* ***t]

A tip with strong text
Bold on "tip with strong": A **tip with strong** text   [tip with strong]
Italic on "A **t": *A* ***t*ip with strong** text   [A* ***t]

x"y"z
Bold on "\"y\"": x<b>"y"</b>z   ["y"]

a b c
Italic on " b ": a *b* c   [ *b* ]

a `b`c
Bold on "a `b`": <b>a `b`</b>c   [a `b`]

a.b
Italic on "a.": <i>a.</i>b   [a.]

Write
Bold on "t": Wri**t**e   [t]

ab
Italic on "a": *a*b   [a]
Bold on "b": *a***b**   [b]

a **b** c
Bold on "a **b** c": **a b c**   [a b c]
Bold on "a b c": a b c   [a b c]

a *b* _c_ d
Italic on "a *b* _c_ d": *a b c d*   [a b c d]

a word
Underline on "word": a <u>word</u>   [word]
Strikethrough on "word": a <u>~~word~~</u>   [word]

x [link](a.md) y
Bold on "lin": x **[link](a.md)** y   [lin]
Code on "link": no change

a `b` c
Code on "a `b` c": `a b c`   [`a b c`]
Code on "a b c": a b c   [a b c]

a `x*y` c
Code on "x*y": a x\*y c   [x\*y]

tick ` here
Code on "tick ` here": ``tick ` here``   [``tick ` here``]

**a b** c
Code on "b** c": **a** `b c`   [`b c`]

<u>a **b</u> c**
Underline on "a": <u><u>a</u> **b</u> c**   [a]

> a *b
> c* d
Underline on "a *b\n> c* d": > <u>a *b
> c* d</u>   [a *b
> c* d]

| a | b |
|---|---|
| c | d |
Bold on "a | b |\n|---|---|\n| c": | **a** | **b** |
|---|---|
| **c** | d |   [a** | **b** |
|---|---|
| **c]

